Subject: [PATCH 205/220] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on session link
 titles and paste repair

Key the title by session id, show it only when the text is the href's own session, cache with a TTL and a short failure memory, keep attachments ahead of the paste repair, survive a throwing execCommand, and leave one-space custom URLs alone.
